WEBVTT

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:33.503
"Remember that
there is a guy named Baker."

00:09:33.527 --> 00:09:35.009
That's his name.

00:09:35.033 --> 00:09:39.797
And I say to you, "Remember
that there is a guy who is a baker."

00:09:39.821 --> 00:09:40.986
Okay?

00:09:41.454 --> 00:09:44.636
And I come back to you
at some point later on,

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:48.355
and I say, "Do you remember that word
that I told you a while back?

00:09:48.379 --> 00:09:50.251
Do you remember what it was?"

00:09:50.275 --> 00:09:53.518
The person who was told his name is Baker

00:09:53.542 --> 00:09:56.603
is less likely to remember the same word

00:09:56.627 --> 00:09:59.905
than the person was told
his job is a baker.